{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06966","headline":"淮南秋夜呈周偘 · 李嶷","name":"淮南秋夜呈周偘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天净河汉高，夜闲砧杵发。\n清秋忽如此，离恨应难歇。\n风乱池上萍，露光竹间月。\n与君共游处，勿作他乡别。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嶷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06966.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06966","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}